<title>USA: Crane Co says it buys Westinghouse unit.</title>
<headline>Crane Co says it buys Westinghouse unit.</headline>
<dateline>STAMFORD, Conn 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crane Co said Monday it completed the acquisition of the nuclear valve division of ITI Movats from Westinghouse Electric Corp.</p>
<p>ITI Movats, a wholly-owned subsidary of Westinghouse, supplies valve diagnostic equipment and valve services to the commercial nuclear power industry.</p>
<p>Crane is a manufacturer of engineered industrial products and a distributor of doors, windows and millwork.</p>
<p>A purchase price was not disclosed.</p>
